; GoDaddy DNS zone import — GitHub Pages for Mog-academy/portfolio-practice
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 1. Replace EVERY occurrence of YOURDOMAIN.COM with your real domain
;    (e.g. elgaili.com) — keep the trailing dots on FQDNs.
; 2. In GoDaddy DNS, delete any conflicting A / AAAA / CNAME on @ or www
;    (parked page, forwarding, old hosts) or the import will fail.
; 3. DNS → Actions → Import Zone File → apply this file.
; 4. GitHub repo Settings → Pages → Custom domain = your apex or www.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

$ORIGIN YOURDOMAIN.COM.
$TTL 3600

; Apex → GitHub Pages (IPv4)
@       3600    IN      A       185.199.108.153
@       3600    IN      A       185.199.109.153
@       3600    IN      A       185.199.110.153
@       3600    IN      A       185.199.111.153

; Apex → GitHub Pages (IPv6)
@       3600    IN      AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       3600    IN      AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       3600    IN      AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       3600    IN      AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153

; www → GitHub Pages org site
www     3600    IN      CNAME   mog-academy.github.io.
